# What ships in the VSIX
#
# This file is an allowlist, not a blocklist. Everything in the repository is
# excluded first, then the extension payload is added back one entry at a time.
#
# The extension is native, so the package must stay free of the optional Python
# distribution in this repository. New files ship only when explicitly listed.
# `scripts/audit-vsix.js` re-checks the built archive mechanically.
#
# vsce always includes package.json. The Marketplace README, changelog, and
# license are explicitly included below.

